{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Starting Out", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "My Favorite Things", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Time", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these words to talk about parts of the day:<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">morning</span> - from around 5:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m.*<br/><span class = \"strong\">afternoon</span> - from 12:00 noon to around 6:00 p.m.<br/><span class = \"strong\">evening</span> - from around 6:00 p.m. to 12:00 midnight.<br/><span class = \"strong\">night</span> - from around 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 a.m.<br/><br/>*12:00 p.m. is <span class = \"italic\">noon</span>, when you eat lunch<br/>12:00 a.m. is <span class = \"italic\">midnight</span>, at night<br/><br/>You use these words to talk about parts of the week:<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">weekday</span> - Monday - Friday<br/><span class = \"strong\">weekend</span> - Saturday + Sunday<br/><br/>These words can be placed in the plural form to  show you do something on a regular basis.<br><br>We use prepositions when we talk about the times in the day and week.<br> We use <span class=\"strong\">IN</span> for long parts of the day: in the morning, in the afternoon, in the evening. <br>We use <span class=\"strong\">ON</span> for parts of the week: on weekdays (Monday to Friday), on the weekend.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The library is closed in the evenings.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The restaurant is open in the afternoons and in the evenings on weekends.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I go to work on Saturdays.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Likes and Dislikes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Simple tense to talk about things you like or don't like. <br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Positive expressions</span>:<br/>I love \u263a\u263a\u263a <br/>I'm a fan of \u263a\u263a<br/>I like \u263a<br/><br/><span class = \"underline\">Negative expressions</span>:<br/>I don't like \u2639<br/>I hate \u2639\u2639<br/>I can't stand \u2639\u2639\u2639", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I love Japanese food!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't like Mexican food very much.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I can't stand small olives.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "open", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ready for business", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is the restaurant open on Saturdays?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you plan to meet a person.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hungry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "wanting food", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm hungry! When is lunch?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "perfect", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without problems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: 7 o' clock is perfect.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fantastic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very good", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That's fantastic!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "weekend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Saturday and Sunday", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The restaurant is closed on the weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to meet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to see someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's meet at 7 p.m.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I can't stand ...", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I hate ...", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can't stand Jello.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I'm a fan of ...", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I like something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm a fan of Japanese food.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "big", "type": "name"}, {"content": "large in size", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love big tuna rolls.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "small", "type": "name"}, {"content": "limited in size", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Examples: I don't like small olives.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le01ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write 3-4 things you do on a regular day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the time of day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your list with a partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 2 sentences. Start your sentences with the time of day, such as: <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIn the mornings, we ...\u201d</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences out loud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I express my daily routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about what I do every day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask about another person's daily routines.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le01ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "id": 0, "text": "", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "1", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you like Mexican food, John?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: No, I don't like Mexican food very much. It's too spicy.", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "7500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: How about Greek food?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Oh no. I can't stand small olives.", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "13700", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Japanese?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Yes, I love Japanese food! Why?", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "20750", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: My birthday is next Wednesday. Want to go to Koi's Sushi Inn?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Sure! That's my favorite restaurant. I'm a fan of their big tuna rolls, but I don't like the soup.", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "34000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I like everything on the menu.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Oh wait!  They are closed on weekdays.", "image": "engenn2le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "42000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Is it open on weekends?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Yes, they are open in the afternoons and in the evenings on the weekend.",